      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the logic for a new smart home security app. We're training the AI to categorize activity. If a camera captures a person in a dark hoodie walking slowly down a sidewalk at night and looking at house numbers, how should the system categorize that? Is that a routine occurrence or something that should trigger a \"suspicious activity\" alert?",
